  - id: 24472cbf59744116b1f0d4fbb1bf9032
    title: TextMeshPro optional dependency isolation or asmdef declaration
    body: 'Fit / relevance: Compile safety / optional dependencies

      Current
      evidence: FontPreviewWindow.cs uses TMPro; PaletteApplyUtility uses reflection/string
      optional handling; Editor asmdef has no TMP reference

      Notes: PaletteApplyUtility
      mostly handles TMP optionally. FontPreviewWindow is compile-time TMP-dependent
      and should be moved to a TMP bridge or the Editor asmdef should declare Unity.TextMeshPro
      where appropriate.

      Difficulty: Medium


      Area: Core / Architecture

