      Coverage - Audio Catalog Coverage: Audio Catalog Coverage can audit missing
      or incomplete audio mappings.\r\n  - Recommendation: Open Audio Catalog Coverage
      and refresh catalog coverage for the project audio data.\r\n- **Info** - Project
      Audit / Audio Setup Coverage - Audio Setup Coverage: Audio Setup Coverage can
      validate reusable audio setup profiles against scenes, prefabs, fields, and
      assets.\r\n  - Recommendation: Open Audio Setup Coverage and run the coverage
      review for the relevant profile.\r\n- **Info** - Project Audit / Coverage Matrix
      - Coverage Matrix: Coverage Matrix can track expected coverage dimensions,
